| MPU6050 Pin | Connect To Arduino    |
| ----------- | --------------------- |
| VCC         | 5V                    |
| GND         | GND                   |
| SDA         | A4                    |
| SCL         | A5                    |
| INT         | (leave empty for now) |


| BMP280 Pin | Connect To Arduino |
| ---------- | ------------------ |
| VCC        | 3.3V (recommended) |
| GND        | GND                |
| SDA        | A4                 |
| SCL        | A5                 |



Arduino A4  ─────┬── MPU6050 SDA
                  └── BMP280 SDA

Arduino A5  ─────┬── MPU6050 SCL
                  └── BMP280 SCL

Arduino GND ─────┬── MPU6050 GND
                  └── BMP280 GND



Full Power Setup 
| Arduino Pin | Connect To   |
| ----------- | ------------ |
| 5V          | MPU6050 VCC  |
| 3.3V        | BMP280 VCC   |
| GND         | All GND pins |
